      "side": 1,
      "message": "all these pkg-config invocations are incorrect.  they\u0027re being expanded \u0026 executed for every invocation.  this is why we normally have the pattern:\n\n```\nLIBS_LIBUSB   :\u003d $(shell $(PKG_CONFIG) --libs   libusb-1.0)\nCFLAGS_LIBUSB :\u003d $(shell $(PKG_CONFIG) --cflags libusb-1.0)\n...\nLIBS +\u003d $(LIBS_LIBUSB)\nCFLAGS +\u003d $(CFLAGS_LIBUSB)\n```\n\ncomes up below too with libcrypto",
      "revId": "fa61ddfb41e2945991a9c02e683399dcea7418a9",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
