      "side": 1,
      "message": "i grok this is a test, and it\u0027s probably (hopefully) not being invoked automatically by the build, but it\u0027s still wrong.  this should be CC+CFLAGS+CPPFLAGS like normal.  if you want to force -O0, append it.  you could even avoid defining a rule at all.\n\n```\ndesc_parser.o: CFLAGS +\u003d -O0\nparser_debug: desc_parser.o\n```\n\nalthough that doesn\u0027t handle the weird `parser_debug` -\u003e `dp` rename.  i guess you want `make parser_debug` to always run the tool and never check timestamps as to the binary being up-to-date relative tot he inputs ?",
